; 080 message ROM contents (2716): the page, 16 rows of 16 character codes at row x 16 + column
; (docs/machines/080-message/MESSAGE.md). Emily Dickinson, "Hope" is the thing with feathers (1891),
; first stanza.

20*16             ; row 0
20*16             ; row 1
"\"HOPE\" IS THE   " ; row 2
"THING WITH      " ; row 3
"FEATHERS -      " ; row 4
"THAT PERCHES    " ; row 5
"IN THE SOUL -   " ; row 6
"AND SINGS THE   " ; row 7
"TUNE WITHOUT    " ; row 8
"THE WORDS -     " ; row 9
"AND NEVER STOPS " ; row 10
"- AT ALL -      " ; row 11
20*16             ; row 12
"EMILY DICKINSON " ; row 13
20*16             ; row 14
20*16             ; row 15
